{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00024",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 6.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Okay, so hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.19,
      "end_seconds": 12.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.51,
      "end_seconds": 19.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "I mean, I'm here because of a red swollen area on my leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.45,
      "end_seconds": 22.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.17,
      "end_seconds": 26.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "About... well, two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.0,
      "end_seconds": 34.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.88,
      "end_seconds": 51.64,
      "duration_seconds": 13.76,
      "text": "Yeah, it settles a little with elevating the leg. I notice it more with walking. It happens once or twice a day. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.72,
      "end_seconds": 54.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.47,
      "end_seconds": 77.59,
      "duration_seconds": 21.12,
      "text": "It, It usually comes with a small cut that wasn't healing. The small cut that wasn't healing? That's been since last weekend. Okay, um, so as for small cut that wasn't healing, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. There was pain in that area, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.44,
      "end_seconds": 80.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "And calf pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.15,
      "end_seconds": 84.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No. No calf pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.49,
      "end_seconds": 90.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Any red streaks going up the leg, shortness of breath, numbness around it or pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.43,
      "end_seconds": 99.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "Yeah, no red streaks going up the leg, shortness of breath, numbness around it or pus, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.5,
      "end_seconds": 104.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.64,
      "end_seconds": 107.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.07,
      "end_seconds": 110.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Alright, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.61,
      "end_seconds": 114.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.3,
      "end_seconds": 121.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Right, are you on any tablets or medication? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.03,
      "end_seconds": 140.69,
      "duration_seconds": 18.66,
      "text": "Metformin. I take it 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day. I took the morning off to come in today. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. Paracetamol. I take it 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.93,
      "end_seconds": 145.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.25,
      "end_seconds": 158.92,
      "duration_seconds": 11.67,
      "text": "Hmm, um, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.31,
      "end_seconds": 160.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.61,
      "end_seconds": 165.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.05,
      "end_seconds": 168.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.53,
      "end_seconds": 173.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.17,
      "end_seconds": 177.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.9,
      "end_seconds": 197.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Right, carry on. Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.22,
      "end_seconds": 202.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Just a C-section, about ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.89,
      "end_seconds": 206.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "So, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.46,
      "end_seconds": 211.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I mean, my sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.74,
      "end_seconds": 215.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.56,
      "end_seconds": 220.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.06,
      "end_seconds": 222.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.06,
      "end_seconds": 230.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Okay, so I've got low haemoglobin. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.43,
      "end_seconds": 232.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.89,
      "end_seconds": 241.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "I mean, yes, high blood pressure. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.12,
      "end_seconds": 252.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.65,
      "text": "Right. Yes, I can see the low haemoglobin in your file as well. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 253.88,
      "end_seconds": 260.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temp 38.6 degrees, saturation 98 percent. Pulse 89, pressure 117 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.74,
      "end_seconds": 262.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.07,
      "end_seconds": 268.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.62,
      "end_seconds": 269.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.26,
      "end_seconds": 273.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.35,
      "end_seconds": 292.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "The skin on the lower leg is red, warm and swollen, about the size of my palm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.78,
      "end_seconds": 298.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.99,
      "end_seconds": 310.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "There's a small scab where the cut was, no pus coming out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.99,
      "end_seconds": 312.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.71,
      "end_seconds": 339.93,
      "duration_seconds": 24.22,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with cellulitis. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. A deep vein clot is also on my list. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a red swollen area on your leg for two days, and no shortness of breath or red streaks going up the leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.44,
      "end_seconds": 343.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.89,
      "end_seconds": 346.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.21,
      "end_seconds": 365.4,
      "duration_seconds": 18.19,
      "text": "Um, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.22,
      "end_seconds": 380.59,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for infection. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'd like to arrange a wound swab for infected wound. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.95,
      "end_seconds": 395.84,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "I'd like you to take cephalexin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, for seven days. You take it by mouth. It's for skin infection. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.26,
      "end_seconds": 397.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.37,
      "end_seconds": 421.44,
      "duration_seconds": 23.07,
      "text": "Mark the edge of the redness with a pen so we can see whether it spreads. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Keep an eye out, and if the redness spreads or the fever gets higher, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.12,
      "end_seconds": 424.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 425.18,
      "end_seconds": 427.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Let's review you in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.35,
      "end_seconds": 431.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.14,
      "end_seconds": 436.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.26,
      "end_seconds": 439.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    }
  ]
}